      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kenyon%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic Gunderson House stands as a landmark of Kenyon's early industrial heritage.",
